2.0877.043Application No. or Publication No.: 202111429987.5    Issue No.: 2024050900154920 Applicant or Patentee: THE SECOND HOSPITAL OF TIANJIN MEDICAL UNIVERSITY
Title of Invention: MALE PENIS SITE MAGNETIC RESONANCE IMAGING INTEGRATED COIL HAVING ERECTION ASSISTING FUNCTION
Notification to Grant Patent Right for Invention
1. In accordance with Article 39 of the Patent Law and the provision of Rule 54 of its Implementing Regulations, for the aforesaid application for a patent for invention, where no grounds for rejection have been found after the substantive examination, Notification to Grant Patent Right for Invention should be made.
After receiving the Notification to Grant Patent Right for Invention, the applicant shall go through the formalities of registration according to content of the Notification to go through Formalities of Registration.
After the applicant has gone through the formalities of registration within the prescribed time limit, the State
Intellectual Property Office shall make a decision to grant the Patent right, issue the certificate of patent for invention, and register and announce it.
If the applicant does not go through the formalities of registration within the prescribed time limit, he or it shall be deemed to have abandoned his or its right to obtain the patent right.
Law or administrative regulation provides that the implementation of the corresponding technology should go through such procedures as approval or registration, the relevant provisions should be followed.
2. The aforesaid application for a patent for invention that shall be granted is on the basis of the following application documents:
O Original application documents Q Documents submitted on the date of submission of divisional application D Following application documents
The specification drawings and abstract drawings submitted on the application date; Paragraphs 1-32 and abstract of the specification submitted on December 20, 2021; Claims 1-9 submitted on April 26, 2024
3. The title of aforesaid application for a patent for invention that shall be granted is: I Not changed   Q Changed from
to
the aforesaid title.
4. Q Upon examination, the declaration of abandonment of patent right (Publication No.  ) submitted by the application on   - 
-     has:
O Entered the procedure of abandonment of patent right.
O Not entered the procedure of abandonment of patent right. The reason is: the patent right declared to abandon by the application and this patent application is not regarded as identical invention-creation. 5. Q The amendments Ex officio made by the examiner to the application documents are as follows:
6. Q The applicant submitted additional experimental data after the application date, which was not included in the authorization announcement text.
Note: The amended documents received after this notification was issued, which are made by the applicant on his own initiative, shall not be accepted.
