The applicant submitted the statement of opinion and the revised application documents on December 11,2023. After reading the above documents, the examiner continued the review of the case and again submitted the following review opinions.
I. Statement of opinions for the applicant:
The applicant considers that:
The technical problem solved by the comparison document 1 is to improve the resolution of prostate imaging, while this application is to solve the poor imaging effect and invasive injection defects; the comparison document 1 does not have improved enlightenment; the comparison document 1 does not have the sleeve; the comparison document 2 exposes the magnetic field to assist the penis in the magnetic resonance imaging of this application; and the structure of the coil is not disclosed; therefore, the comparison document 1 and the comparison document 2 do not have combined enlightenment.
The examiner considers that
1. As stated by the applicant, the technical problem to be solved in this application is non- invasive nuclear magnetic resonance, and the core technical scheme adopted is to dilate the penile blood vessels through negative pressure attraction.
Comparison document 1 discloses a coil arrangement for NMR. Technicians in the field shall know that, Which similarly requires an NMR in the presence of vascular dilation, Patent CN 1124446A (Open date: June 12,1996), US2017340266A1 (Open date: November 30,2017), magnetic resonance imaging in the treatment of ED after penile prosthesis implantation (Li Zhiming et al., Chinese CT and MRI Magazine, Volume 3, Issue 3, Page 54-55, July 31,2005) exposed the penis in erection during magnetic resonance. Based on this, those skilled in the art know that the difference with this application is how to achieve penile noninvasive erection and nuclear magnetic resonance.
For the technical characteristics, contrast file 2 open physiotherapy, and specific (see
instruction page 3 line 22-page 4 line 6) open using the principle of vacuum negative pressure, the male genital penis negative pressure vacuum stretching traction, Chinese herbal medicine reflux at the same time, increase the supply of human blood, increase the blood volume of penis cavernosum. The outside of male genital penis can increase magnetic field, magnetic resonance and other physical auxiliary therapy. That is, comparison document 2 gives the negative pressure traction to stretch the penis, set the coil at the penis cannula, that is, contrast document 2 can realize the nuclear magnetic imaging of the penis. Based on this, those skilled in the art are motivated to improve the contrast file 1, namely a casing with an NMR coil to achieve NMR of the penis. Furthermore, the comparison document 3 discloses that the penis can be placed in an erect
state by negative pressure. In addition, for those skilled in the art, in order to improve the effect of MRI imaging, the coil structure is a conventional technical means according to requirements, and the technical effect can be expected.
Therefore, the applicant's statement of opinion is not persuasive.
