ength button 413 can adjust the size of negative pressure generated in the penile prosthesis 300 after the vacuum pump 450; Touch the suction rate control button 411, 412 can adjust the size of the pumping rate of the vacuum pump 450 (that is, the controller (12) is disclosed to control the pressure size in the negative pressure tube (2)). Therefore, the comparison document 3 discloses the distinguishing technical features, and the function realized in the comparison document 3 is the same as that realized in this claim, in that the penis erection is realized by negative pressure. On this basis, for those skilled in the art, the penis erection by negative pressure, the" negative pressure tube (2) is provided in the chamber of the sleeve (1), the negative pressure tube (3) has the pressure gauge connected to the controller; the negative pressure tube (2) is provided with the exhaust hole (9), the exhaust hole (9) is provided with the first butterfly needle valve, and the controller controls the pressure duration in the negative pressure tube for the conventional setting.
