0.1230.808.The applicant should pay attention to the followings statements:
(1) In accordance with Article 37 of the Patent Law, the applicant should submit the written opinion within four months from the date of receipt of this Office Action. If, without any justified reason, the time limit for reply is not met, the application shall be deemed to have been withdrawn.
